  "translation": "Today is Saturday, the weather is very good. In the morning, my mother and I went to the supermarket together. There were not many people in the supermarket. We first bought two apples and a cup of milk. Then we saw father's friend. He was also shopping. He asked us how many people are in our family. We said there are three. He then asked if we would go eat together. We said yes. Then he asked where we would go eat. We said to that restaurant. Then the three of us happily went to the restaurant together. The food at the restaurant was very delicious. We ate dumplings and also drank black tea. We were all very happy. In the evening we went home. Today was really happy. Next time we will come again."
